Z||000000||superXmotorsports||12-20-1999||08:29 PM||||I have removed the manual mirror glass with ease but don't understand the power mirror assembly.  Can this be accomplished w/o removing the entire mirror?  Mr Ogre please come out of the tunnel and help me!  SXM.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||TOM||12-20-1999||08:35 PM||||Just grab the glass with the plactic backing and pull. It will either pop off the pivots or pull the pivots out with it. Then just line them up and push to get it back in.||||reg||1
Z||000002||TOM||12-20-1999||08:35 PM||||The glass is bonded to the backing with silicone||||reg||1
